<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Guión Ejecutivo — Renovación Servicio Qinaya (503 Licencias en 21 Colegios de Mayor Uso y Sin Quejas)</title>
<style>
  @page {
    size: 8.5in 11in;
    margin: 0.85in 0.9in;
  }
  body {
    font-family: 'Calibri', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 11.5pt;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #1e293b;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 20pt;
    color: #0f172a;
    border-bottom: 3px solid #2563eb;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .subtitle {
    font-size: 11pt;
    color: #475569;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 14pt;
    color: #ffffff;
    background-color: #1e3a8a;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    margin-top: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .objective-box {
    background-color: #eff6ff;
    border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .speech-box {
    background-color: #f8fafc;
    border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    margin: 10px 0;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #0f172a;
  }
  .chart-box {
    background-color: #f0fdf4;
    border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    margin: 10px 0;
  }
